      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "The concept of global stewardship was first articulated by several thinkers in the early twentieth century. It emphasizes collective responsibility for the well-being of shared resources and the importance of long-term planning across generations and communities."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Over the decades, the idea gained traction in environmental policy discussions. Various governments and international bodies adopted frameworks that incorporated elements of this concept into their planning and regulatory approaches."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "blockquote",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "p",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Like a vessel carrying all of humanity, our world requires the care and cooperation of every passenger aboard. We must work together to ensure a safe and prosperous journey for generations to come."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "The phrase has been used by numerous organizations to promote awareness of shared environmental challenges."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "h2",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Criticism"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Scholar "
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "a",
          "attributes": [
            [
              "href",
              "https://thin-section-before-see-also/wiki/Example_Author"
            ]
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Jane Doe"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": " has argued that, if implemented, the concept would represent a significant constraint on "
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "a",
          "attributes": [
            [
              "href",
              "https://thin-section-before-see-also/wiki/Individual_Liberty"
            ]
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "individual liberty"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": " and local governance."
        },
